[2026-03-14T20:44:56.720Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NxzbEdHvg5HwikJ4Hzmti5","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've now comprehensively analyzed all the netlify functions. Let me compile the complete database schema based on all the SQL queries I found. Here's a comprehensive report:\n\n## LinearClone Database Schema\n\nBased on thorough analysis of all 26 netlify function files, here is the complete database schema:\n\n### 1. TABLES REFERENCED IN SQL QUERIES\n\n#### **members**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `email` (TEXT)\n- `password_hash` (TEXT)\n- `password_salt` (TEXT)\n- `role` (TEXT - 'admin' or 'member')\n\n#### **sessions**\nColumns:\n- `token` (TEXT, PRIMARY KEY or UNIQUE)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- `expires_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **issues**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id)\n- `title` (TEXT)\n- `description` (TEXT, nullable)\n- `status` (TEXT - values: 'backlog', 'todo', 'in_progress', 'in_review', 'done', 'cancelled')\n- `priority` (TEXT - values: 'urgent', 'high', 'medium', 'low', 'none')\n- `number` (INT - sequential per team)\n- `due_date` (DATE, nullable)\n- `assignee_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `project_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> projects.id, nullable)\n- `cycle_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> cycles.id, nullable)\n- `parent_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id, nullable - for sub-issues)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n- `updated_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **teams**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `identifier` (TEXT - 2-5 char uppercase prefix, UNIQUE)\n- `description` (TEXT, nullable)\n\n#### **team_members**\nColumns:\n- `team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- Composite PRIMARY KEY: (team_id, member_id)\n\n#### **projects**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `description` (TEXT, nullable)\n- `status` (TEXT - values: 'planned', 'in_progress', 'completed', 'cancelled')\n- `target_date` (DATE, nullable)\n- `lead_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **labels**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT, UNIQUE or case-insensitive unique)\n- `color` (TEXT)\n\n#### **issue_labels**\nColumns:\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id)\n- `label_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> labels.id)\n- Composite PRIMARY KEY: (issue_id, label_id)\n\n#### **cycles**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `start_date` (DATE)\n- `end_date` (DATE)\n- `team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id)\n- `status` (TEXT - implied as 'active' or similar, nullable)\n\n#### **comments**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- `content` (TEXT)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **activity**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `action` (TEXT - description of the action taken)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n- `field` (TEXT, nullable - used in cycle-issues for burndown tracking: 'status')\n- `new_value` (TEXT, nullable - used for burndown: 'done')\n\n#### **notifications**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- `type` (TEXT - 'assigned', 'comment')\n- `message` or `description` (TEXT)\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id, nullable)\n- `read` (BOOLEAN)\n- `archived` (BOOLEAN)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **project_milestones**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `project_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> projects.id)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `target_date` (DATE, nullable)\n- `completed` (BOOLEAN)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP, implied)\n\n#### **project_activity**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `project_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> projects.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `action` (TEXT)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **workspaces**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `default_team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id, nullable)\n\n### 2. FOREIGN KEY RELATIONSHIPS\n\n| Table | Column | References | Notes |\n|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| sessions | member_id | members.id | CASCADE delete implied |\n| issues | team_id | teams.id | REQUIRED - issues must belong to team |\n| issues | assignee_id | members.id | Nullable - unassigned issues allowed |\n| issues | project_id | projects.id | Nullable - issues can exist outside projects |\n| issues | cycle_id | cycles.id | Nullable - issues not assigned to cycle |\n| issues | parent_id | issues.id | Nullable - self-referencing for sub-issues |\n| team_members | team_id | teams.id | CASCADE delete |\n| team_members | member_id | members.id | CASCADE delete |\n| projects | lead_id | members.id | Nullable - projects without lead |\n| issue_labels | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| issue_labels | label_id | labels.id | CASCADE delete on label removal |\n| cycles | team_id | teams.id | CASCADE delete |\n| comments | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| comments | member_id | members.id | Preserve or set to NULL on member delete |\n| activity | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| activity | member_id | members.id | Can be NULL for system actions |\n| notifications | member_id | members.id | CASCADE delete |\n| notifications | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| project_milestones | project_id | projects.id | CASCADE delete |\n| project_activity | project_id | projects.id | CASCADE delete |\n| project_activity | member_id | members.id | Can be NULL |\n| workspaces | default_team_id | teams.id | Nullable |\n\n### 3. INDEXES/CONSTRAINTS MENTIONED\n\n**Explicit in queries:**\n- `labels.name` - Case-insensitive unique constraint (LOWER function used)\n- `teams.identifier` - Unique, case-insensitive (UPPER function used)\n- `members.email` - Appears to be unique (checked for duplicates)\n- `issues.number` + `issues.team_id` - Composite unique per team\n- Sessions check: `expires_at > NOW()` - Time-based validation\n\n**Recommended from usage patterns:**\n- `issues.team_id` - Indexed (filtered heavily)\n- `issues.assignee_id` - Indexed (filtered in my-issues)\n- `issues.project_id` - Indexed (filtered in projects)\n- `issues.cycle_id` - Indexed (filtered in cycle-issues)\n- `issues.parent_id` - Indexed (sub-issue lookups)\n- `issue_labels.issue_id` - Indexed (label lookups via ANY)\n- `issue_labels.label_id` - Indexed (cleanup on label delete)\n- `team_members.team_id` - Indexed (member lookups)\n- `team_members.member_id` - Indexed (team lookups)\n- `sessions.token` - Indexed (auth lookups)\n- `sessions.member_id` - Indexed (cleanup on member delete)\n- `activity.issue_id` - Indexed (activity history lookups)\n- `notifications.member_id` - Indexed (unread count, fetch notifications)\n- `comments.issue_id` - Indexed (comment fetch)\n- `project_milestones.project_id` - Indexed\n- `project_activity.project_id` - Indexed\n\n### 4. SPECIAL DATA TYPE NOTES\n\n- **UUIDs**: All primary keys use UUID type\n- **Dates**: `due_date`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `target_date` stored as DATE\n- **Timestamps**: `created_at`, `updated_at`, `expires_at` use TIMESTAMP with timezone\n- **Enums**: Status values are stored as TEXT, not PostgreSQL ENUM type\n- **Boolean**: `completed` in milestones, `read` and `archived` in notifications\n\n### 5. DATABASE-SPECIFIC FEATURES USED\n\n- **PostgreSQL functions**: \n  - `NOW()` for current timestamp\n  - `COALESCE()` for null handling\n  - `COUNT(*)::int` for integer casting\n  - `CASE WHEN` for conditional counts\n  - `DATE()` for date extraction\n  - `UPPER()` and `LOWER()` for case-insensitive comparisons\n  - `ANY()` for array matching (issues with label filtering)\n  - `ILIKE` for case-insensitive LIKE matching\n  - `CONCAT()` for string concatenation\n  - `DISTINCT ON` for query optimization\n\n### 6. MISSING NULLABLE/NOT NULL CONSTRAINTS\n\nBased on usage, likely NOT NULL columns:\n- `members.id, name, email, password_hash, password_salt`\n- `issues.id, team_id, title, status, priority, number, created_at, updated_at`\n- `teams.id, name, identifier`\n- `sessions.token, member_id`\n- `projects.id, name, status`\n- `labels.id, name, color`\n- `cycles.id, name, start_date, end_date, team_id`\n\nLikely NULLABLE:\n- `members.role` (assumed 'member' default)\n- `issues.description, assignee_id, project_id, cycle_id, parent_id, due_date`\n- `teams.description`\n- `projects.description, target_date, lead_id`\n- `cycles.status`\n- `notifications.issue_id`\n- `activity.member_id, field, new_value`\n- `comments.member_id` (possibly)\n- `project_activity.member_id`\n\nAll files analyzed:\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/login.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/signup.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/me.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/notifications-count.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/my-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue-status.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/notifications.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/bulk-update-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/create-issue.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/search-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/add-comment.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/issue-detail.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/cycles.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/cycle-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/projects.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/project-detail.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-project.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/project-milestones.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/members.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-members.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/teams.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/labels.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/workspace.ts`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a04ae5da87781c903 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 73558\ntool_uses: 31\nduration_ms: 38043</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fce00bd2-5cbf-4ef5-a5c6-94d6b48a030d","uuid":"c9e89dcc-b87c-479e-b28a-10052dff5606","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the LinearClone app at /repo/apps/LinearClone to determine the database schema needed. Search through all netlify/functions/*.ts files and look for SQL queries (tagged template literals with `sql`) to identify all tables, columns, and relationships used. Also check src/slices/*.ts for API response shapes. \n\nReturn a comprehensive list of:\n1. All tables referenced in SQL queries\n2. All columns for each table\n3. All foreign key relationships\n4. Any indexes or constraints mentioned\n\nBe very thorough - check every function file.","agentId":"a04ae5da87781c903","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've now comprehensively analyzed all the netlify functions. Let me compile the complete database schema based on all the SQL queries I found. Here's a comprehensive report:\n\n## LinearClone Database Schema\n\nBased on thorough analysis of all 26 netlify function files, here is the complete database schema:\n\n### 1. TABLES REFERENCED IN SQL QUERIES\n\n#### **members**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `email` (TEXT)\n- `password_hash` (TEXT)\n- `password_salt` (TEXT)\n- `role` (TEXT - 'admin' or 'member')\n\n#### **sessions**\nColumns:\n- `token` (TEXT, PRIMARY KEY or UNIQUE)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- `expires_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **issues**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id)\n- `title` (TEXT)\n- `description` (TEXT, nullable)\n- `status` (TEXT - values: 'backlog', 'todo', 'in_progress', 'in_review', 'done', 'cancelled')\n- `priority` (TEXT - values: 'urgent', 'high', 'medium', 'low', 'none')\n- `number` (INT - sequential per team)\n- `due_date` (DATE, nullable)\n- `assignee_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `project_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> projects.id, nullable)\n- `cycle_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> cycles.id, nullable)\n- `parent_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id, nullable - for sub-issues)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n- `updated_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **teams**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `identifier` (TEXT - 2-5 char uppercase prefix, UNIQUE)\n- `description` (TEXT, nullable)\n\n#### **team_members**\nColumns:\n- `team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- Composite PRIMARY KEY: (team_id, member_id)\n\n#### **projects**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `description` (TEXT, nullable)\n- `status` (TEXT - values: 'planned', 'in_progress', 'completed', 'cancelled')\n- `target_date` (DATE, nullable)\n- `lead_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **labels**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT, UNIQUE or case-insensitive unique)\n- `color` (TEXT)\n\n#### **issue_labels**\nColumns:\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id)\n- `label_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> labels.id)\n- Composite PRIMARY KEY: (issue_id, label_id)\n\n#### **cycles**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `start_date` (DATE)\n- `end_date` (DATE)\n- `team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id)\n- `status` (TEXT - implied as 'active' or similar, nullable)\n\n#### **comments**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- `content` (TEXT)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **activity**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `action` (TEXT - description of the action taken)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n- `field` (TEXT, nullable - used in cycle-issues for burndown tracking: 'status')\n- `new_value` (TEXT, nullable - used for burndown: 'done')\n\n#### **notifications**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id)\n- `type` (TEXT - 'assigned', 'comment')\n- `message` or `description` (TEXT)\n- `issue_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> issues.id, nullable)\n- `read` (BOOLEAN)\n- `archived` (BOOLEAN)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **project_milestones**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `project_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> projects.id)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `target_date` (DATE, nullable)\n- `completed` (BOOLEAN)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP, implied)\n\n#### **project_activity**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `project_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> projects.id)\n- `member_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> members.id, nullable)\n- `action` (TEXT)\n- `created_at` (TIMESTAMP)\n\n#### **workspaces**\nColumns:\n- `id` (UUID, PRIMARY KEY)\n- `name` (TEXT)\n- `default_team_id` (UUID, FOREIGN KEY -> teams.id, nullable)\n\n### 2. FOREIGN KEY RELATIONSHIPS\n\n| Table | Column | References | Notes |\n|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| sessions | member_id | members.id | CASCADE delete implied |\n| issues | team_id | teams.id | REQUIRED - issues must belong to team |\n| issues | assignee_id | members.id | Nullable - unassigned issues allowed |\n| issues | project_id | projects.id | Nullable - issues can exist outside projects |\n| issues | cycle_id | cycles.id | Nullable - issues not assigned to cycle |\n| issues | parent_id | issues.id | Nullable - self-referencing for sub-issues |\n| team_members | team_id | teams.id | CASCADE delete |\n| team_members | member_id | members.id | CASCADE delete |\n| projects | lead_id | members.id | Nullable - projects without lead |\n| issue_labels | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| issue_labels | label_id | labels.id | CASCADE delete on label removal |\n| cycles | team_id | teams.id | CASCADE delete |\n| comments | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| comments | member_id | members.id | Preserve or set to NULL on member delete |\n| activity | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| activity | member_id | members.id | Can be NULL for system actions |\n| notifications | member_id | members.id | CASCADE delete |\n| notifications | issue_id | issues.id | CASCADE delete |\n| project_milestones | project_id | projects.id | CASCADE delete |\n| project_activity | project_id | projects.id | CASCADE delete |\n| project_activity | member_id | members.id | Can be NULL |\n| workspaces | default_team_id | teams.id | Nullable |\n\n### 3. INDEXES/CONSTRAINTS MENTIONED\n\n**Explicit in queries:**\n- `labels.name` - Case-insensitive unique constraint (LOWER function used)\n- `teams.identifier` - Unique, case-insensitive (UPPER function used)\n- `members.email` - Appears to be unique (checked for duplicates)\n- `issues.number` + `issues.team_id` - Composite unique per team\n- Sessions check: `expires_at > NOW()` - Time-based validation\n\n**Recommended from usage patterns:**\n- `issues.team_id` - Indexed (filtered heavily)\n- `issues.assignee_id` - Indexed (filtered in my-issues)\n- `issues.project_id` - Indexed (filtered in projects)\n- `issues.cycle_id` - Indexed (filtered in cycle-issues)\n- `issues.parent_id` - Indexed (sub-issue lookups)\n- `issue_labels.issue_id` - Indexed (label lookups via ANY)\n- `issue_labels.label_id` - Indexed (cleanup on label delete)\n- `team_members.team_id` - Indexed (member lookups)\n- `team_members.member_id` - Indexed (team lookups)\n- `sessions.token` - Indexed (auth lookups)\n- `sessions.member_id` - Indexed (cleanup on member delete)\n- `activity.issue_id` - Indexed (activity history lookups)\n- `notifications.member_id` - Indexed (unread count, fetch notifications)\n- `comments.issue_id` - Indexed (comment fetch)\n- `project_milestones.project_id` - Indexed\n- `project_activity.project_id` - Indexed\n\n### 4. SPECIAL DATA TYPE NOTES\n\n- **UUIDs**: All primary keys use UUID type\n- **Dates**: `due_date`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `target_date` stored as DATE\n- **Timestamps**: `created_at`, `updated_at`, `expires_at` use TIMESTAMP with timezone\n- **Enums**: Status values are stored as TEXT, not PostgreSQL ENUM type\n- **Boolean**: `completed` in milestones, `read` and `archived` in notifications\n\n### 5. DATABASE-SPECIFIC FEATURES USED\n\n- **PostgreSQL functions**: \n  - `NOW()` for current timestamp\n  - `COALESCE()` for null handling\n  - `COUNT(*)::int` for integer casting\n  - `CASE WHEN` for conditional counts\n  - `DATE()` for date extraction\n  - `UPPER()` and `LOWER()` for case-insensitive comparisons\n  - `ANY()` for array matching (issues with label filtering)\n  - `ILIKE` for case-insensitive LIKE matching\n  - `CONCAT()` for string concatenation\n  - `DISTINCT ON` for query optimization\n\n### 6. MISSING NULLABLE/NOT NULL CONSTRAINTS\n\nBased on usage, likely NOT NULL columns:\n- `members.id, name, email, password_hash, password_salt`\n- `issues.id, team_id, title, status, priority, number, created_at, updated_at`\n- `teams.id, name, identifier`\n- `sessions.token, member_id`\n- `projects.id, name, status`\n- `labels.id, name, color`\n- `cycles.id, name, start_date, end_date, team_id`\n\nLikely NULLABLE:\n- `members.role` (assumed 'member' default)\n- `issues.description, assignee_id, project_id, cycle_id, parent_id, due_date`\n- `teams.description`\n- `projects.description, target_date, lead_id`\n- `cycles.status`\n- `notifications.issue_id`\n- `activity.member_id, field, new_value`\n- `comments.member_id` (possibly)\n- `project_activity.member_id`\n\nAll files analyzed:\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/login.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/signup.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/me.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/notifications-count.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/my-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue-status.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/notifications.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/bulk-update-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/create-issue.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/search-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/add-comment.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/issue-detail.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/cycles.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/cycle-issues.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/projects.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/project-detail.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-project.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/project-milestones.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/members.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-members.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/teams.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/labels.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/workspace.ts`"}],"totalDurationMs":38043,"totalTokens":73558,"totalToolUseCount":31,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1640,"cache_read_input_tokens":68563,"output_tokens":3350,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16